{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108040","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1110804001:1":{"text":"您好！请问，你有见过一群从荒角沙漠来的蛮血孩子吗？","source_cn":"您好！请问，你有见过一群从荒角沙漠来的蛮血孩子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2FCD9978620489A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110804002:1":{"text":"哟。哪来的小仓鼠？","source_cn":"哟。哪来的小仓鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B4C843453AAAEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110804003:0":{"text":"不是普通的仓鼠！是使魔！","source_cn":"不是普通的仓鼠！是使魔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECCE79F612F73E8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110804004:1":{"text":"抱歉抱歉，是我怠慢了。\n路经荒角沙漠，蛮血孩子我见过很多……有没有具体一点的描述？","source_cn":"抱歉抱歉，是我怠慢了。\\n路经荒角沙漠，蛮血孩子我见过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37151DF21C71FB21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110804005:0":{"text":"……乌尔氏族，我的同胞。","source_cn":"……乌尔氏族，我的同胞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EF07BF8A69A1E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110804006:0":{"text":"他们跟着外来商队来寻宝，至今未归。","source_cn":"他们跟着外来商队来寻宝，至今未归。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07E9D2408E7B8C7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110804007:0":{"text":"哎呀，小兄弟，你说的外来商队，恰好就是我们！","source_cn":"哎呀，小兄弟，你说的外来商队，恰好就是我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2240D87633EFB0EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110804008:0":{"text":"我们商队曾经在乌尔氏族停留过，你们的部族成员挺友善，主动分享绿洲里的水给我们喝。","source_cn":"我们商队曾经在乌尔氏族停留过，你们的部族成员挺友善，主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0AB55DD7219356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110804009:1":{"text":"作为回报，我们把宝藏的消息告诉他们了，你们部族有人很感兴趣，硬要跟我们一起上路。","source_cn":"作为回报，我们把宝藏的消息告诉他们了，你们部族有人很感...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADFB9DCAC8598FD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110804010:0":{"text":"我们卖货，他们寻宝，互不耽误，路上还能互相做个照应，多好！","source_cn":"我们卖货，他们寻宝，互不耽误，路上还能互相做个照应，多好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77CF0100F6DCDCF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110804011:0":{"text":"……其他人呢？这里就你一个。","source_cn":"……其他人呢？这里就你一个。","status":"matched","ha